# This project has no .env file: the website is static and every secret lives in a dashboard, never in the repository.
# Names only (no values) — set them where shown.
#
# Supabase → Edge Functions → Secrets (for supabase/functions/send-push):
VAPID_PUBLIC=
VAPID_PRIVATE=
VAPID_SUBJECT=mailto:
ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://aspironeducation.com,https://www.aspironeducation.com,https://aspiron-dev.github.io
# SUPABASE_URL and SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY are given to the function by Supabase itself.
#
# GitHub → Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions (for .github/workflows/db-backup.yml):
SUPABASE_DB_URL=
BACKUP_PASSWORD=
# RCLONE_CONFIG=   (optional)
#
# Public by design (already in config.js): the Supabase URL, the publishable key, VAPID_PUBLIC.
